1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:05,760
The stalking resulting in death supports the firearm counts.

2
00:00:06,410 --> 00:00:11,370
Are you asking me to call this shooting nonviolent?

3
00:00:19,800 --> 00:00:31,050
No. The act was violent. The question is whether the charged stalking statutes satisfy the legal predicate for these firearm counts.

4
00:00:38,800 --> 00:00:52,150
The two firearm counts are dismissed. The two stalking-resulting-in-death counts remain. The death penalty is no longer available in this federal case.

5
00:00:55,800 --> 00:01:00,230
Can I call my mom? Tell her myself?

6
00:01:00,880 --> 00:01:05,840
When you get back. I'll send her the order.

7
00:01:06,490 --> 00:01:07,550
Tomorrow?

8
00:01:08,200 --> 00:01:11,580
Tomorrow. But read the whole thing.

9
00:01:20,800 --> 00:01:26,800
Her lawyer wants all the messages. You don't have to agree.

10
00:01:27,450 --> 00:01:30,310
This one should help her.

11
00:01:30,960 --> 00:01:34,340
Your message is right above it.

12
00:01:34,990 --> 00:01:36,270
I know.

13
00:01:36,920 --> 00:01:40,300
Can you send her reply first?

14
00:01:45,800 --> 00:01:52,330
Not as the complete exchange. Her lawyer asked for the whole thread.

15
00:01:52,980 --> 00:01:55,840
And if I say no?

16
00:01:56,490 --> 00:02:01,970
I tell her lawyer no. We keep preparing your case.

17
00:02:10,800 --> 00:02:22,570
Once we send it, they can use all of it. This says you'd decided earlier. Not just the lines that help her.

18
00:02:26,800 --> 00:02:29,660
Will they leave her alone?

19
00:02:30,310 --> 00:02:39,990
I can't promise that. They can still question her about leaking records. And you can still say no.

20
00:02:42,800 --> 00:02:44,610
Leave mine in.

21
00:02:45,260 --> 00:02:47,070
Date and all?

22
00:02:47,720 --> 00:02:48,780
Yes.

23
00:02:59,300 --> 00:03:02,680
All of it. To her lawyer.

24
00:03:03,330 --> 00:03:05,660
That's what I'll send.
